  <datafield tag="500" ind1=" " ind2=" ">
    <subfield code="a">Small accordion-folded booklet in blue slipcase. Silkscreen printing on the board case, digital printing collage and text of the book. Die cut application on the envelope. Issued in small white paper bag with the words "Saque y lea!" printed in blue.</subfield>
  </datafield>
